WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:0
We play red and move first. Every piece is public.
Checkmate the opposing general to win.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:15.750 line:0
Select a piece, then a legal point. Our cannon
jumps the black cannon: it captures over one piece.

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:21.000 line:0
The black chariot recaptures.
Every capture appears in the move list.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:31.999 line:0
The horse goes one point straight, then diagonally.
A piece on the first point blocks it.

00:00:31.999 --> 00:00:44.999 line:0
Fast-forward: chariots, horses and cannons trade.
Elephants never cross the river; advisors stay in.

00:00:44.999 --> 00:00:51.749 line:0
The black chariot takes a soldier with check.
Our advisor steps between chariot and general.

00:00:51.749 --> 00:00:54.998 line:0
The black cannon checks over the advisor and
the general has no escape. Checkmate.

00:00:54.998 --> 00:01:04.000 line:0
After 46 moves red is checkmated; black wins.
No legal move while not in check also loses.
